# Safety and boundaries

## Do not modify

- **`vendor/`** and other **TuyaOS / RTOS kernel** trees shipped with the SDK.
- **TCP/IP stack internals**, **`tuya_iot_*` protocol stack internals**, **DP/MQTT packing** — compliance and OTA risk; integrate only via supported **callbacks / public APIs**.

## Thread safety (audio path)

- In **`__on_ai_toy_mic_data`** (microphone callback): **no blocking calls, no heavy inference.** Offload with **`tal_workq`** or a **dedicated thread**; move frame data through **lock-free ring buffers**.

## Extension points (prefer these)

- **Dialogue modes / state machine:** `src/mode/`
- **AI skills:** `src/wukong/skills/`
- **MCP tools:** `src/wukong/mcp/tools/`
- Every new **`*.c`**: register in **`apps/tuyaos_jiajia/local.mk`**.
